  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Gajar ka "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "halwa",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "halwa"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is made by cooking grated carrot in milk until the milk evaporates completely, then frying in ghee. Adding a little double cream at the end approximates the richness of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "khoya ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "khoya"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", which is difficult to find outside specialist shops."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use a wide pan for maximum evaporation. Stir frequently in the later stages to prevent sticking."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
